      "reason": "Make the three challenge distributions reproducible and identify shortcuts that could explain rank differences.",
      "query": "For sequential recommendation diagnostics comparing uniform training-sampler, popularity-matched, and TF-IDF title/description-similar distractors, how should popularity bins, similarity reference items, unique candidate sampling, exclusions, missing-text fallbacks, and deterministic ties be specified? What controls separate semantic difficulty from popularity and metadata-coverage effects when distractor relevance is unknown?"
    },
